{#-
  BLOCK: masthead — §06's `masthead`. The gradient banner: logo, report title,
  date range, and the one headline figure.

  Invariant across all eight report types, per §06 — only the strings change.

  VML FIRST, AND IT IS NOT REDUNDANT. Outlook renders no CSS gradient at all, so
  the `v:rect` with `v:fill type="gradient"` is the only banner Outlook shows;
  the `background-color` on the table is the flat fallback for clients that do
  neither. Three renderings of one band, which is ordinary in email and looks
  like duplication to anyone who has not had to do it.

  EVERY TEXT COLOUR HERE IS `on_band`, DERIVED AGAINST BOTH GRADIENT STOPS.
  It used to be hardcoded `#ffffff` with `rgba(255,255,255,0.7)` for the muted
  lines. White is fine at the navy end and 1.98:1 at the lime end — a band is
  not one background, and a colour chosen against its first stop is not chosen
  at all. `_on_band()` picks whichever of white or near-black has the better
  WORST case across the stops. The muted lines keep their quietness with
  `opacity`, which degrades to full strength in Outlook: the measured ratio
  assumes it is ignored, so it is safe either way.
-#}
          <!-- ========== HEADER: 3-row gradient banner ========== -->
          <tr>
            <td>
              <!--[if mso]>
              <v:rect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" fill="true" stroke="false" style="width:600px;height:130px;">
                <v:fill type="gradient" color="{{ primary_color }}" color2="{{ accent_color }}" angle="115"/>
                <v:textbox inset="24px,20px,24px,18px" style="mso-fit-shape-to-text:true">
              <![endif]-->
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background: linear-gradient(115deg, {{ primary_color }} 0%, {{ primary_color }} 30%, {{ accent_color }} 100%); background-color: {{ primary_color }}; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
                <!-- ROW 1: Centered logo -->
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 24px 12px;">
                    {% if logo_url %}<img src="{{ logo_url }}" alt="{{ brand_name }}" style="display: block; max-height: 45px; max-width: 180px; width: auto; height: auto; margin: 0 auto;" />{% endif %}
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <!-- ROW 2: Title (65%) + Metric (35%) -->
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 0 24px;">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                      <tr>
                        <td width="65%" style="vertical-align: middle;">
                          <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: {{ on_band }};">
                            {{ title }}
                          </p>
                          <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; color: {{ on_band }}; opacity: 0.85;">
                            {{ subtitle }}
                          </p>
                        </td>
                        <td width="35%" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: right;">
                          <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: {{ on_band }};">
                            {{ metric_value }}
                          </p>
                          <p style="margin: 2px 0 0 0; font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; color: {{ on_band }}; opacity: 0.85; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
                            {{ metric_label }}
                          </p>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <!-- ROW 3: Bottom spacer -->
                <tr>
                  <td style="height: 18px; font-size: 0; line-height: 0;">&nbsp;</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <!--[if mso]>
                </v:textbox>
              </v:rect>
              <![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr>
